<b>T A G  F I E L D S

<c>[1·Browser]         First Browser
<c>[2·Browser]         Second Browser
<c>->  [4/6·Fields]    First fields-tab (Genres, Artists, Albums)
<c>->  [7/9·Fields]    Second fields-tab (AlbumArtists, Composers, Years)

Use 4 to 9 focus-keys to select one field-window for the current Browser.
Otherwise, click on the tab-labels.
Each fields-tab contains 3 field-windows. Click inside a field-window to select
it.

Use arrowUp, arrowDown or mouse1 to select a field-value.
Use the "Activate sel" command or mouse3 to activate/deactivate a field-value.
